  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[0.7 × 0.4 ÷ (0.28 - 0.2 × 0.3) + 1.2 × 1.6]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[0.7 × 0.4 ÷ (0.28 - 0.2 × 0.3) + 1.2 × 1.6]\n\n⇒ [0.7 × 0.4 ÷ (0.28 - 0.06) + 1.2 × 1.6]\n\n⇒ [0.7 × 0.4 ÷ 0.22 + 1.2 × 1.6]\n\n⇒ [0.7 × (0.4)/(0.22) + 1.2 × 1.6]\n\n⇒ [(0.28)/(0.22) + 1.92]\n\n⇒ [(28)/(22) + (192)/(100)]\n\n⇒ [(1400+2112)/(1100)]\n\n⇒ (3512)/(1100)\n\n⇒ (878)/(275)\n\n**∴ The required answer is (878)/(275).**",
